{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11235010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123501001:0":{"text":"마스터, 하쉬르의 새로운 거처는 안전할까요? 그 고집쟁이 할아버지가 잘 지내고 있을지 모르겠어요.","source_cn":"主人，哈什尔的新住所安全吗？这个固执的老头子最近如何了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC00B3792D305ACBB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 하쉬르의 새로운 거처는 안전할까요? 그 고집쟁이 할아버지가 잘 지내고 있을지 모르겠어요.","female":"마스터, 하쉬르의 새로운 거처는 안전할까요? 그 고집쟁이 할아버지가 잘 지내고 있을지 모르겠어요.","variant_male_record_index":"127719","variant_female_record_index":"127720","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123501002:0":{"text":"시간도 거의 다 되었으니 크루거에게 물어보러 가자.","source_cn":"时间也差不多了，我们去向克鲁格问问看吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEFF8430639E4DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시간도 거의 다 되었으니 크루거에게 물어보러 가자.","female":"시간도 거의 다 되었으니 크루거에게 물어보러 가자.","variant_male_record_index":"127721","variant_female_record_index":"127722","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11235020.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123502001:1":{"text":"멀린 님, 좋은 소식이 있습니다!","source_cn":"梅林大人，我这里有个好消息！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FEE3EC4D4970FCC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님, 좋은 소식이 있습니다!","female":"멀린 님, 좋은 소식이 있습니다!","variant_male_record_index":"127723","variant_female_record_index":"127724","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123502002:1":{"text":"하쉬르의 새로운 거처를 찾았습니다. 그리고 그와 이야기를 하러 가기로 했어요!","source_cn":"我找到了哈什尔的新住处，并且已经决定要去和他谈谈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04426A8EB5766DFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123502003:1":{"text":"저와 함께 가주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"你们能陪同我一起过去看看吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B1827749CBF311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123502004:1":{"text":"줄곧 그를 보살펴 왔으니 여러분이 함께 해주신다면 우리 사이의 갈등을 풀 수 있을지도 모릅니다.","source_cn":"一直以来都是你们在照顾他，也许你们在场的话，能缓和我和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7CBB539F162788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1123502004":{"text":"줄곧 그를 보살펴 왔으니 여러분이 함께 해주신다면 우리 사이의 갈등을 풀 수 있을지도 모릅니다.","source_cn":"一直以来都是你们在照顾他，也许你们在场的话，能缓和我和他之间的矛盾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7CBB539F162788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123502005:1":{"text":"고맙습니다. 저를 정말 많이 도와주시는군요.","source_cn":"谢谢，你帮我太多了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF929E9E6464D2879","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고맙습니다. 저를 정말 많이 도와주시는군요.","female":"고맙습니다. 저를 정말 많이 도와주시는군요.","variant_male_record_index":"127728","variant_female_record_index":"127729","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123502007:1":{"text":"블랙하울 부족을 위한 공헌을 꼭 기억하겠습니다!","source_cn":"我会记得，尊贵朋友们为黑嚎氏族带来的贡献！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607673DB4275A5B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"(흔쾌히 승낙한다)","source_cn":"（欣然答应）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5B0A1235C472D241","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(흔쾌히 승낙한다)","female":"(흔쾌히 승낙한다)","variant_male_record_index":"64932","variant_female_record_index":"64933","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123502006:1":{"text":"이게 하쉬르의 뜻에 어긋난다는 건 알지만, 그래도 이렇게 포기할 수 없습니다.","source_cn":"我知道这违背他的意愿，但我不能就这样放弃了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3B6B2C3F1A2AC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"(난감해하며 고개를 끄덕인다)","source_cn":"（为难地点点头）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD81229D7D1E76C0C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(난감해하며 고개를 끄덕인다)","female":"(난감해하며 고개를 끄덕인다)","variant_male_record_index":"64934","variant_female_record_index":"64935","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11235030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123503001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 크루거. 대체...?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x58C952EE86F0F98B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 크루거. 대체...?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 크루거. 대체...?","variant_male_record_index":"127732","variant_female_record_index":"127733","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"하쉬르","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11235040.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123504001:1":{"text":"지난번에 알아듣게 말했던 것 같은데. 전통을 따라야 한다고 하지 않았나.","source_cn":"我以为上次的对话能让你明白，遵循传统是必要的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4457D575C4BB125E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123504002:1":{"text":"여긴 대체 뭐 하러 온 거지? 전통을 따른 나를 비웃기라도 하러 온 것인가?","source_cn":"你现在来做什么？来看我遵循传统的结果并羞辱我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03828D564DA923A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123504003:1":{"text":"그런 악의를 가지고 온 사람은 없습니다.\n그저 당신이 있어야 할 곳으로 돌아왔으면 하기를 바랄 뿐입니다.",